WEBVTT

00:00:56.912 --> 00:01:00.537
picturing some situations where new 
international laws could be necessary.

00:01:00.537 --> 00:01:04.413
Imagine a new kind of assassin
that can commit a crime

00:01:04.413 --> 00:01:08.288
without firing any shot
nor being in the victim’s country.

00:01:08.288 --> 00:01:12.704
For example, a person working 
for the government uses a wireless device

00:01:12.704 --> 00:01:15.954
to send a signal 
to a foreign head of state’s pacemaker

00:01:15.954 --> 00:01:17.954
causing the disruption of the pacemaker

00:01:17.954 --> 00:01:20.246
and death of the foreign head of state.

00:01:20.246 --> 00:01:24.163
Would this cyber murder
represent an act of war?

00:01:24.329 --> 00:01:27.496
As a second example,
imagine a group of allied nations

00:01:27.496 --> 00:01:31.496
sneaking inside the informatics
of a nuclear warship